{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of staring at a static screen? inScreen Dream Keyboard brings a dynamic and interactive 3D keyboard to your desktop that responds to your real-life typing, making every keystroke a delightful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Typing Sync:                    A beautiful 3D keyboard on your screen perfectly mimics your physical keystrokes in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works in the Background:      Enjoy the animations while using any other application, be it for work or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Unique Keycaps:           Swap your keycaps with a massive collection of creative and fun designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful Interactions:               Experience satisfying animations! Type on a sheep keycap and watch it jiggle, or press a corn keycap to see it pop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Customization:              Freely adjust camera angles, change keyboard cases, and set the perfect lighting to create your ideal virtual keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download inScreen Dream Keyboard today and make your desktop truly yours!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861410?t=1754189104","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861410?t=1754189104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861410/17ad76fe3b21fe37b122f2f651637f1f20f3d004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754189104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861410/17ad76fe3b21fe37b122f2f651637f1f20f3d004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754189104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of staring at a static screen? inScreen Dream Keyboard brings a dynamic and interactive 3D keyboard to your desktop that responds to your real-life typing, making every keystroke a delightful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Typing Sync:                    A beautiful 3D keyboard on your screen perfectly mimics your physical keystrokes in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works in the Background:      Enjoy the animations while using any other application, be it for work or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Unique Keycaps:           Swap your keycaps with a massive collection of creative and fun designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful Interactions:               Experience satisfying animations! Type on a sheep keycap and watch it jiggle, or press a corn keycap to see it pop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Customization:              Freely adjust camera angles, change keyboard cases, and set the perfect lighting to create your ideal virtual keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download inScreen Dream Keyboard today and make your desktop truly yours!</p>","developers":["wadomachi studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861410/8780e5c69909622fc94008f9c57d02d0d30cd2c5/header.jpg?t=1754189104","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861410/1386738592/02863a1cc0d2fc93a953d3ee117b9051a70b386f/1752070833/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752303536","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861410/1386738592/02863a1cc0d2fc93a953d3ee117b9051a70b386f/17